<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dispel Magic</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 17), Conjurer (guild level 30)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast dispel magic &lt;target&gt;
cast dispel magic &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Tears spells off a person, a creature or an object, one after another. It 
removes, among others: bless and unholy blessing, the detect spells, 
invisibility, charm, hold, haste, quicken and slow, poison, rage and berserk, 
magic light and darkness, enchanted weapons and armour, the raise spells, and 
the resistances. The better your spell, the more it removes: up to fifteen 
for a master.
</p><p>It also breaks spells such as sleep, plague and madness, when your spell is 
at least as strong as they were. It doesn't touch sanctuary, the skin spells, 
protection from evil, life protection or sustain.
</p><p>It is hard work: each spell removed costs you 20 endurance, and if your 
endurance runs out you fall stunned. You need more than 20 endurance to begin. 
You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Displace Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>